Z||000000||Max The Chainsaw||06-20-2001||01:12 AM||||Hi all, After almost 3 months of work, the Grape Ape is back on the roads. I'm sooooo Happy!! I'm gonna try to post some pics of it. Too bad it rained......<P>Oh BTW, don't let my wife hear ya call it the "Grape Ape" anymore..... She's been known to maime for less.. LOL<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero013.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero015.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero017.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero018.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero023.jpg"> <P>I Hope that's not too many pictures, but I AM proud of my baby.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Thanks go out to Monkey Man for the car, Mr Mike for the seats, Paul McKibbin for the sail panels, Coultas Recycling for a BUNCH of parts, and my wife for her hard work helping me with it. And special thanks for all here who through their posts have answered a lot of questions I have had during this project, mostly in the archives.<P>Thanks again.<BR> <BR>||||reg||10
