Z||000010||Max The Chainsaw||06-21-2001||12:19 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by trigger:<BR><B>Looks great.  I was wondering about those sub boxes.  What size subs are those?  Do they sound good?  Are the boxes big enough?  Thanks.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>They aren't really subs, just 5 inch round speakers in boxes. I never really liked the seat speakers so these are the replacements, sound is good though.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000011||Max The Chainsaw||06-21-2001||12:21 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Steve Normington:<BR><B>What does NGT WLF stand for?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's another of the wifes things.... she's into the wolf chat rooms and wanted this for "Night Wolf"  I prefer the plates on our family car myself "GDDAY M8" Got that from Crocodile Dundee...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
