Z||000018||The Fieromaster||06-21-2001||01:03 AM||||Whooo Hoo Im not the only guy with a Purplified Fiero!!  My car is about the same color but it looks different in the pics i have!  Car looks GREAT man! Here is my baby!<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=595986&a=13186915&p=49973383&Sequence=0&res=high">  <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">   <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||10
