Z||000020||The Fieromaster||06-21-2001||01:20 AM||||Actually i think that would be a WICKED race but the Eclipse woulda dusted the Fiero i think...<BR>Eclipse was like 14.5 in the 1/4<BR>Fiero Is 15.5 in the 1/4<P>But in top end Fiero would so get stomped  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> cause i have had my Eclipse to 150mph! 140 once in the RAIN (wipers then ceased to touch windshield!)  And it got to 140 pretty QUICK!  Man i missed that!  Turbo RULES!  Ive never been in a car that launched like the Eclipse either.. a small TWEAK and it was gone... AWD is SWEET!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">   <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||1
Z||000021||FieroKyle||06-21-2001||01:25 AM||||I got to my fiero to 130 to 140 once, after the speedometer came back around to zero, (speedo only goes to 85 in my car) it got really jumpy and I couldn't tell how fast i was going from then on. I dunno about, I think fiero might win on quarter mile, i got mine to a 14.8 before, but your right, top end and the rice burner is gone, sucks though, no offense but i hate mitubishi and other over rated jap sports car, I get sick of hearing of they are so great and all and they really. Anyways, thanks for the input.<P>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
