Z||000024||The Fieromaster||06-21-2001||02:00 AM||||Actually the Eclipse's, Talon's and Laser's arent really that rice!  The car is all Chrysler except for the drivetrain... although that makes up allot you gotta admit the Jap's make MEAN engines!  GM needs to get their $hit together and run with the GOOD DOHC motors they made so far instead of dropping them... <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">   <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||1
Z||000025||The Fieromaster||06-21-2001||02:49 AM||||~!UNINTED!~<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">   <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||10
Z||000026||fyerstarter||06-21-2001||03:56 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by The Fieromaster:<BR><B>Actually the Eclipse's, Talon's and Laser's arent really that rice!  <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>They aren't rice at all. <P>Rice is a Hyundai with racing stickers all over it and a 4 foot wing. <P>Rice is a DX Civic with SI-R badges on it, a six inch exhaust, a 5 inch tach and nothing else.<P>Rice is a Fiero with more than three of the following: Side Scoops, Sail Panel Scoops, Wing Extensions, Hood Vents, Deck Scoops, Chin Spoiler, or HVAC ducts running into the Engine Cooling Vents. <P><BR>I too had a Turbo Eclipse. It was fast as hell, a nice looking car, and a helluva lot more reliable than my 2 Fieros. If that qualifies as rice then I am a proud Ricer  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
